 cial afternoon of film\, music\, community\, and remembrance. Be among th
 e first to experience THE 100TH: Seeds of Aloha \, a feature-length docum
 entary honoring Hawaiʻi’s legendary 100th Infantry Battalion and 442nd
  Regimental Combat Team.\nhttps://sfpl.org/events/2026/11/12/film-100th-s
 eeds-aloha
URL:https://sfpl.org/events/2026/11/12/film-100th-seeds-aloha
END:VEVENT
